{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete\nGO:0050484 GMP 5'-nucleotidase activity\nGO:0050483 IMP 5'-nucleotidase activity\nGO:1990224 NMN phosphatase activity\nGO:0050340 thymidylate 5'-phosphatase activity\nGO:0106411 XMP 5'-nucleosidase activity\n(transfer annotations to parent GO:0008253 5'-nucleotidase activity or GO:0002953 5'-deoxynucleotidase activity)\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29438.\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WmXVxy0o5w7GgZJuKKAF260rurvQr3-JzrU-8vjwgNE/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nUniProt\t15 (automatic transfer)\nEcoCyc\t2\nMGI\t7 (automatic transfer)\nSGD\t3 (automatic transfer)\nTAIR\t1\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nInterPro:IPR009453 IMP-specific 5-nucleotidase > GO:IMP 5'-nucleotidase activity ; GO:0050483\n\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-03-06T01:25:59Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to children of 5'-nucleotidase activity (with replacement)", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-03-13T06:51:57Z"}
